Classification guidance:
- Choose "pm_parent" when the issue describes a feature, redesign, initiative, user problem, workflow change, or broad request that likely needs decomposition into multiple engineering slices.
- Choose "engineering_child" when the issue already describes a concrete implementation slice, bugfix, narrow technical task, or a single bounded change an engineer could take directly.
- Choose "unclear" when the issue is too vague or mixed to route confidently.

Be conservative. If the issue could reasonably require PM decomposition, prefer "pm_parent" over "engineering_child".
